OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fperiods and the odd shower this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night be
OL,8,Fmainly dry with variable amounts of
OL,9,Fcloud, the odd shower across the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FAfter a dry start widespread
OL,12,Frain, occasionally heavy, will spread
OL,13,Fnortheast during the morning. Drier
OL,14,Fand clearer weather will spread from
OL,15,Fthe west later in the afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,18,Fwith some sunshine on Monday. Windy
OL,19,Fand mainly dry on Tuesday, but patchy
OL,20,Frain possible in the afternoon. Bright
OL,21,Fwith a few showers on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
